        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Dr. Maté will be presenting at the Lighthouse Arts Centre, 1800 Argyle St, Halifax, Nova Scotia, Canada, on October 18, 2024, 9:00am – 4:00pm.   Based on The Myth of Normal: Trauma, Illness and Healing in a Toxic Culture  More information on this event can be found on Dr. Gabor Maté’s website  HERE"
      }
