        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Kings of Hali is the largest fighting game event in Atlantic Canada. Come as we celebrate our 7th edition bigger and better than ever with more games than ever before! With competitors from all over the country, fierce rivalries and non-stop action, Kings of Hali 7 promises to deliver an unforgettab"
