      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "VIBRANCY FESTIVAL 2024  JULY 12 &amp; 13, 2024  Halifax’s premier electronic festival returns for 2 days and 2 nights this July. Brace yourself for over 20hrs of world class electronic music squeezed into 4 unique shows, in 4 incredible venues, all culminating with our main event Saturday night"
