      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "We’re back with the Summer Lovin’ Edition of ~ The Underground ~  Saturday June 29th   Doors @8pm | Show @8:30pm   19+ admitted/Bar service   Theme/Dress Code: Dirty Dancing…. (the movie of course)   Secret location released 24hrs in advance via text/email.   A la a true speakeasy this is a pho"
