      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Join us for our first autumn market on Saturday, August 10, 2024 at Light House Arts Centre, 1800 Argyle Street, 11am - 5pm to support local businesses.   At the heart of this unique event lies a passionate mission – to celebrate and empower small businesses of all kinds.   70+ Vendors!  Free Entry!"
