        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Many documentaries tell important stories. Few bear real time witness to atrocities of our time. 20 DAYS IN MARIUPOL, from filmmaker and Pulitzer Prize-winning journalist Mstyslav Chernov, is one of them.  Synopsis:  An AP team of Ukrainian journalists trapped in the besieged city of Mariupol strugg"
      }
