        "@value": "The Curio Collective is kicking off 2024 with the SPRING VINTAGE SHOW on May 11-12 with over 40 of the East Coast’s TOP vintage and antique sellers bringing the best of their collections for you to explore and purchase!  Since 2019, the Curio Collective is Halifax’s biggest exclusively vintage and a"
      }
