      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Choir! Choir! Choir! is a singing experience where the crowd is the star!  Part comedy and all interactive, this show is all about YOU!  Nobu and Daveed instantly connect with audiences  to create a group feeling like no other. The best part? NO AUDITIONS!!  Any level of singer is welcome. Show up a"
      }
